  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>All mandragorans have a certain resistance to toxins and poisons, but your very body is poisonous.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Mandragorans or Shenxue with plant-like aspect only; immunity to poisons through a class ability or some other ability.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your blood is poisonous to those who would use a bite attack against you. You inlict a single point of Constitution damage to an opponent who bites or swallows you (DC 10 + half your character level + your Constitution modifier) as part of its attack.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc88\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
